'''Drezar''' were a [[species]] [[Homeworld|native]] to the [[planet]] [[Drez]].<ref name="AcolyteVG" /> The [[bartender]] [[Cabuck]] and his son [[Cabuck Junior]] were members of the species, who lived in [[Point Ueda]] on the [[planet]] [[Ueda]] during the [[High Republic Era]].<ref name="Lost Found" />

